sequenceDiagram
    actor User
    participant DOM as Main JS
    participant W as Rust and worker I/O
    participant H as Native host
    participant DB as Configured store
    User->>DOM: Open Home or Design
    DOM->>W: Flush latest acknowledged workspace
    W->>H: Save checkpoint
    H->>DB: Commit accepted revision
    DB-->>H: Commit acknowledged
    H-->>W: Saved checkpoint
    W-->>DOM: Handoff JSON and saved acknowledgement
    DOM->>DOM: Navigate same tab
    User->>DOM: Return to Chat Mail or Workbench
    DOM->>W: Start fresh owned worker
    W->>H: Resume admission and restore
    H-->>W: Catalog and accepted snapshot
    W->>W: Restore then dispatch declared entry action
    W-->>DOM: Typed view and entry acknowledgement
    DOM->>DOM: Render and consume matching fragment
    DOM-->>User: Restored view
